  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960219,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Chips: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nStep into the shoes of a fledgling entrepreneur in 1980s Silicon Valley with *1001 Chips*! Armed with a modest $100,000 investment, your mission is to build a thriving software company and amass a fortune. This unique blend of business simulation and adventure game challenges you to navigate the cutthroat world of early computing.\n\nThe game unfolds through a series of text-based scenarios, demanding shrewd decisions about product development, marketing, and resource management. Research new technologies, hire talented programmers, and compete with rival companies for market share. But beware! Unexpected events – from hardware failures to competitor sabotage – can derail your plans.\n\n*1001 Chips* features a branching narrative with multiple endings, influenced by your choices. Success requires a blend of strategic thinking, risk assessment, and a little bit of luck. Can you turn your initial investment into a multi-million dollar empire, or will your company become another footnote in Silicon Valley history? Test your business acumen and see if you have what it takes to conquer the world of software!"
    },
